1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,100
Watch Italy and Britain in the mid-1980s.

2
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:09,418
In 1986, Italy's economy passed Britain's, in dollars.

3
00:00:09,418 --> 00:00:13,350
Italians called it il sorpasso: the overtaking.

4
00:00:13,750 --> 00:00:19,598
Then the lira and the pound trade places. Britain ahead in 1988.

5
00:00:19,598 --> 00:00:21,425
Italy again in 1989.

6
00:00:22,225 --> 00:00:28,169
Italy stays ahead into the 1990s. Then, in 1994, Britain moves ahead,

7
00:00:28,169 --> 00:00:30,150
and this time for good.

8
00:00:30,750 --> 00:00:36,575
Today: the UK, 4 trillion dollars. Italy, 2.55 trillion.

9
00:00:37,775 --> 00:00:41,875
The full race of Europe's biggest economies is on our channel.
